  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>科技 RPG 字型</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">憑藉這款現代、獨特且清晰易讀的科技風格字型，您的原版遊戲體驗將獲得進一步提升。專為&nbsp;<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包打造，現已開放公眾使用！<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字型基於 MADType 推出的熱門 Google 字型 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Aldrich\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aldrich</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字型採用開放字型授權（OFL）發布。<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/632/aldrich-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>螢幕截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/567/85/tech-image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即購買伺服器，與好友暢玩！點擊&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
